              {
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left",
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Margin = (Procore revised budget - forecast final cost) / revised budget. Affect's budgets carry the CM fee as a line (division 50), so the fee is margin, not cost, and is left out of cost. The portfolio figure adds every active project's budget and cost first. Coverage = committed (subcontracts and POs) over the budget of divisions 01-44, dollar for dollar - GCs, insurance, contingency, tax and fee are not bought out.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Arial",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#16283F",
